            <note corresp="#d311-f4" n="4" xml:id="d311-f4-content">
                <p>According to the President’s Daily Diary, this was a luncheon meeting with the
                    President which also included Generals Maxwell Taylor and Earle Wheeler, CIA
                    Director Helms, and Walt Rostow. (Johnson Library)</p>
